  "prefLabel": "En 1502.17 Limited maintenance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.17 \"Limited maintenance\" means necessary maintenance that does not involve construction or modification of any pipeline, cable, or conduit, or a line of poles, towers, or other structures, or any wires or fixtures thereon, and is completed without any alteration of the crossing profile in any way.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
